flow v0
columns side main stop

section "Issue stage"
text maintainer "Maintainer" col=main
pill needs-preparation tone=muted
box issue-preparer "writes scope and criteria" tone=agent
panel prep-stop col=stop row=issue-preparer tone=stop
  pill needs-human
  muted "or an Action needed comment"
pill ready col=main tone=done

section "Pull-request stage"
box implementer "codes, checks, opens the PR" tone=agent
panel pr-stop col=stop row=implementer span=7 tone=stop
  strong "Stop"
  pill blocked
  pill maintainer-merge "maintainer merge"
  rule
  muted "needs-human label or Action needed comment"
  muted "A person decides and adds the trigger label of any role"
  muted "After blocked, the same role retries"
pill needs-review col=main tone=agent
box reviewer "reviews the exact head SHA" tone=agent
pill needs-changes col=side row=reviewer tone=rework
pill needs-security col=main tone=agent
box security-reviewer "checks secrets and permissions" tone=agent
pill ready-to-merge col=main tone=done
box integrator "updates base, checks, merges" tone=agent
end merged "Merged · issue closed"

maintainer --> needs-preparation : adds first label
needs-preparation --> issue-preparer
issue-preparer --> ready : prepared
issue-preparer --> prep-stop tone=stop : stops
ready --> implementer
implementer --> needs-review : handed-off
needs-review --> reviewer
reviewer --> needs-security : approves
reviewer --> needs-changes tone=rework : requests changes
needs-security --> security-reviewer
security-reviewer --> ready-to-merge : approves
security-reviewer --> needs-changes tone=rework from=left to=bottom.3 : requests changes
ready-to-merge --> integrator
integrator --> merged : merges
integrator --> needs-changes tone=rework from=left to=bottom.1 : requests changes
ready-to-merge -.-> needs-changes tone=rework from=left to=bottom.2 : on-conflict · launcher
needs-changes --> implementer tone=rework from=top to=left label=end : revises same PR
implementer --> pr-stop tone=stop to=left.1 : blocked
reviewer --> pr-stop tone=stop to=left.5 : blocked
security-reviewer --> pr-stop tone=stop to=left.9 : blocked
integrator --> pr-stop tone=stop to=left.13 label=end : blocked / maintainer merge
